# SchweisOS License Summary

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0

SchweisOS uses a separated licensing model, as defined in
[ADR-010 Licensing Policy](docs/adr/ADR-010-licensing-policy.md).

## Source Code

Project-owned source code, scripts, packaging helpers, build tooling, tests,
CI configuration, and other executable or code-like files are licensed under:

```text
GPL-3.0-or-later
```

The full GPL-3.0 license text is provided in [COPYING](COPYING).

## Documentation

Project-owned documentation is licensed under:

```text
CC-BY-SA-4.0
```

Documentation files should include this SPDX identifier where practical.

## Artwork and Branding

Non-logo artwork and non-mark visual assets are licensed under
`CC-BY-SA-4.0` by default unless a file states otherwise.

Official names, logos, marks, slogans, and brand identifiers are not granted
for unrestricted use by the software license. SchweisOS is not currently a
registered trademark, but future trademark protection and a formal brand-use
policy are expected before stable public branding.

## Third-Party Material

Third-party software, packages, assets, fonts, icons, documentation, and other
materials remain under their upstream licenses. SchweisOS does not relicense
upstream Arch packages or third-party components.
